{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stelle is included as part of The Bazaar's &quot;Hero Bundle&quot; Edition.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Stelle pack adds the playable hero Stelle to The Bazaar! Each hero brings an entirely new experience to the bazaar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884460/extras/748201891784f528a6c399b01008d56b.poster.avif?t=1755114726\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884460/extras/748201891784f528a6c399b01008d56b.webm?t=1755114726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884460/extras/748201891784f528a6c399b01008d56b.mp4?t=1755114726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Stelle alongside over 150 new items, skills and encounters unique to Stelle</strong>. Engineer your build to perfection with steampunk gadgets and a hangar of aerial machines. Or use the new \u201cfly\u201d effect to send any item skyward\u2014and avoid your enemy\u2019s attempts to drag it down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Stelle\u2019s family as you uncover the story of an heiress turned vigilante. Her eccentric Uncle Odi can teach you everything he knows, but her sister Aleppa may be here to pick a fight. Can Stelle escape the grasp of the Tantius airship dynasty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the wind of freedom when you take to the skies with Stelle! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884460?t=1755114726","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884460/f28260396b8417ce30a607ee6204364b3a90d72c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755114726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor